&lt;p&gt;Scale seeks a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Global Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a high-performing team of technical experts advancing Scale’s assurance programs across its Global Public Sector and Commercial business units.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role for an experienced assurance, cybersecurity compliance, or GRC professional who can manage a team of senior technical experts, drive execution across complex government and customer requirements, and partner closely with Global Public Sector, Enterprise, Security, Engineering, Product, and the Legal team.&lt;/p&gt;
