&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a team of internal researchers, leading research labs across governments, industry, and academia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside a team of internal researchers drive initiatives related to frameworks and benchmarks for frontier AI models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain deeply engaged with the policy and research communities to understand and set trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and coordinate the lab&#39;s projects, partnerships and strategy, including direct work with global AI safety institutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalize, coordinate, and execute the lab&#39;s recruiting plan and research agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you’d have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
