&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Washington, DC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the design, development, and deployment of our agentic AI products in a fast-paced, collaborative, extremely high-visibility environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead a team of 50+ engineers, providing both strategic and technical guidance. You’ll be responsible for high-impact architectural decisions, cross-company collaboration, and executive level engagements.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and mentor a high-performing engineering team of 80+, fostering a culture of technical excellence and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide your team through complex challenges involving LLMs, AI agents, and large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Scale AI in high-stakes negotiations and strategic discussions with senior external partners, demonstrating strong technical competence and credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and communicate a compelling vision for Scale AI’s technology applied to your program. Provide regular updates to senior leadership and key stakeholders on progress, risks, and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Teamwork:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a culture of speed, unity of purpose, resilience, and teamwork. Lead through uncertainty with determination and adaptability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, including 5+ years in a technical leadership or staff role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of modern AI/ML technologies, including experience working with LLMs and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Proficient in one or more modern programming languages (Python, JavaScript/TypeScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes and cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Strong product and business sense, with a track record of aligning engineering efforts with company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Ability to operate effectively in ambiguous, fast-changing environments and guide your team to do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience in executive level engagement with industry partners and Public Sector customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Within 6 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Successful demonstration of agentic AI’s mission value in high-stakes customer demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Establish Scale AI as the preferred agentic AI partner for the PEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Establish high velocity, agile engineering cadence both internally and with our industry partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Within 12–18 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Secure follow-on contract award with expanded scope for Scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li5&quot;&gt;Position Scale AI as the global AI leader in this mission area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Establish developed solutions as Scale product offerings to deliver on future contracts&lt;/li&gt;
