&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt; with strong fundamentals in data structures, algorithms, and system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Python expertise&lt;/strong&gt; with experience in modern ML/AI frameworks (e.g., LangChain, LlamaIndex, HuggingFace, OpenAI API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with cloud platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and modern data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to navigate ambiguous requirements and rapidly iterate toward solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to explain complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
