&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with spatial computing, egocentric vision systems, sensor fusion (LiDAR/IMU/Camera), or AI data curation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing distributed global operations across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth startups or elite technology consulting firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and data visualization tools (Tableau, Looker, etc.) to independently audit program health.&lt;/li&gt;
