&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Intrusion Detection Systems, access control systems, and TEMPEST requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with government security databases (e.g., DISS, NISS, Scattered Castles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
