&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;We review applications on a rolling basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; Candidates will meet with the HFC team to discuss their research experience, professional background, and alignment with our mission to advance human-centered AI.&lt;/li&gt;
